.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_LOMAC_GROK 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_lomac_grok
.Nd overview of the Grok
.Xr mac_lomac 4
package
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr mac_lomac 4
is used because the proof is short: a sandbox subject cannot write-up
into high OS objects after a low read.
This package does not add
.Xr mac_biba 4
or
.Xr mac_mls 4 .
.Ss Roles
Login classes bound to
.Xr pw 8
groups, not per-account specfiles:
.Bl -tag -width sandbox
.It exempt
root class,
.Dq equal(equal-equal)
.It trusted
group
.Dq lomac-trusted ,
class
.Dq trusted ,
label
.Dq high(low-high)
.It sandbox
group
.Dq lomac-sandbox ,
class
.Dq sandbox ,
label
.Dq 10[2]
.Pq handbook default
.El
Unlisted users default to sandbox.
.Ss X11
The official PLM only special-cased
.Pa /tmp/.X11-unix
.Pq XFree86 .
.Pa dev-modern.contexts
maps old PLM
.Pa /dev
nodes
.Pq agp, kmem
to current names
.Pq Pa /dev/dri/card*
as high like agp;
.Pa /dev/mem
still high .
.Pa x11-xorg.contexts
adds
.Xr cleartmp 8
dirs,
.Xr Xorg 1
under
.Pa /usr/local ,
.Pa /dev/dri/renderD* ,
.Pa /dev/input/event*
.Pq evdev 4 ,
.Pa kbdmux
and
.Pa hidraw ,
and
.Pa ~/.Xauthority
as
.Dq equal .
.Ss Recovery
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8 Cm uninstall
restores pre-install behavior from
.Pa PREINSTALL .
Optional
.Xr zfs 8
.Cm snapshot Fl r
and
.Xr zpool-checkpoint 8
are offered before mutation when this package is used standalone.
When composed under
.Xr mac_grok 8 ,
the umbrella owns snapshots.
.Ss Known issues
Handbook ch.19 troubleshooting, mailing-list and PR notes, and the
mismatch between the 2001 USENIX LOMAC trusted-binary list and
.Fx
.Xr mac_lomac 4
are in the package
.Pa README
section
.Dq Known issues .
Walk that before
.Cm enforce .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 4 ,
.Xr mac_lomac_grok 8 ,
